      "side": 1,
      "message": "Also, there is no need to stop and start again if current scannig is active. `(p_inq-\u003escan_type \u003d\u003d BTM_BLE_SCAN_MODE_ACTI)`",
      "revId": "9a59494adb8c88ec5bcaa7719b59ac1c69705452",
